<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Thursday, slaughter steers and heifers sold steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1185-1400 lbs 62.75-64.50. Select and choice 2-3 1150-1375 lbs 61.50-63.00.  Select 2-3 1400-1575 lbs 59.25-61.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Few Choice 2-4 1100-1390 lbs 62.00-63.10. Select 2-3 package 1282 lbs 61.50.</p>
</text>
